From: "pocketforge-agent[bot]"
 <299760760+pocketforge-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 05:10:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/arm: add A133 application virtio-serial

Reserve a second modern virtio-mmio transport for pfvd application bulk traffic. The machine owns its virtio-serial controller while pfvd attaches the named port to the stable child bus.

Cover the collision-checked aperture, IRQ and appended DT node together with positive and negative qtest controls.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
